  "summary": {
    "text": "Claude 3 Haiku is a language model from Anthropic that accepts text and images, positioned by Anthropic as the fast, low-cost model of the Claude 3 family for uses such as live customer chats and data extraction. Named on 2024-03-04 and released on 2024-03-13, it was offered through the Claude API, on claude.ai for Claude Pro subscribers and on Amazon Bedrock.",
